$ enola check .
exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
enola: no mcp-arch.yaml in <TMP>/go_sample, using built-in defaults
enola check: repo <TMP>/go_sample (built-in default config)
enola check: no pinned baseline at <TMP>/go_sample/.enola/baseline

The gate needs a "before" to compare against, pinned BEFORE you edit:
    enola baseline pin <TMP>/go_sample
    …make your change…
    enola check <TMP>/go_sample

Or compare against the immediately-preceding snapshot with --baseline=previous.
